WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.277
- Britney Spears' dad agrees
to step down as conservator

00:00:03.277 --> 00:00:05.060
of Britney Spears' estate,

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:05.893
and on top of that,

00:00:05.893 --> 00:00:09.080
he files a petition to end the
conservatorship in general.

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:10.250
Some have pointed out

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:13.620
that Britney Spears' dad has
received quite a lot of flack

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:17.280
as being the longtime conservator
of Britney Spears' estate.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.530
But recently, after her pleas in court,

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:21.848
he has filed a 112 page petition

00:00:21.848 --> 00:00:23.540
where he agrees to step down,

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:25.630
and ask the court to actually
end the conservatorship.

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:26.540
Well, some have pointed out

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:28.230
that this could be an
entirely cynical move

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:29.570
for him to avoid criticism.

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:31.007
He writes in the petition,

00:00:31.007 --> 00:00:32.948
"If Ms. Spears wants to
terminate the conservatorship

00:00:32.948 --> 00:00:35.460
and believes that she
can handle her own life,

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.070
Mr. Spears believes that
she should get that chance."

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.900
But cynical move or not, the
Free Britney movement appears

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.410
to be as close as they
have ever come to success,

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.760
though we'll have to see
what happens in court.

